    "title": "Voorhees nets the go-ahead goal in Manasquan's victory over RFH - Field hockey recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Reed Becker ,\n43 minutes ago Lorelei Voorhees scored the go-ahead goal in the fourth quarter, leading Manasquan to a 3-2 victory over Rumson-Fair Haven in Rumson. Rumson-Fair Haven led 1-0 at halftime, but Manasquan scored two goals in the third quarter to take a 2-1 lead. Lindsay Notine answered in the third quarter for Rumson-Fair... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
